#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:24
msgid ""
"Provides enhanced terminal accessibility for Windows Terminal and "
"PowerShell, enabling screen reader users to efficiently navigate and "
"interact with command-line interfaces. Inspired by TDSR (Terminal Data "
"Structure Reader) and incorporates functionality from both TDSR and Speakup. "
"Advanced features inspired by community suggestions and discussions."
msgstr ""
"يوفر إمكانية وصول محسّنة إلى Windows Terminal و PowerShell، مما يتيح لمستخدمي "
"قارئ الشاشة التنقل والتفاعل بكفاءة مع واجهات سطر الأوامر. مستوحى من TDSR "
"(Terminal Data Structure Reader) ويضم وظائف من كل من TDSR و Speakup. ميزات "
"متقدمة مستوحاة من اقتراحات ومناقشات المجتمع."

#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:29
msgid ""
"v2.0.0-beta: 24 bug fixes across Python and Rust, 36 fuzz tests, privacy "
"settings panel, ANSI stripping hardened across all speech output paths, "
"combining character support in column extraction, config validation for all "
"settings keys."
msgstr ""

